From e82a5d5280a98e025a7e22410e52c5628b5ca3a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mamam Kasir Dev <dev@mamamayam.local>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 21:26:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: wire Menu Management to real encrypted local DB
 (vertical slice)

- Add AppDatabase: SQLCipher-encrypted SQLite with categories, menu_items,
  variant_groups, variant_options, menu_item_variant_groups tables + demo seed
- Add MenuManagementRepository: full CRUD against the local DB
- Rewrite MenuManagementProvider: async load from repository, loading/error
  state, create/update/deactivate/reactivate actions
- Update domain models: categoryId/categoryName relation, isActive flag
  (soft-delete per edge-case rule), hpp, variantGroupIds
- Wire AddMenuItemModal to real create/update with validation, loading state,
  and edit mode (pass editingItem to pre-fill and update instead of create)
- Wire MenuManagementScreen: tap item to edit, long-press to
  deactivate/reactivate, loading spinner, error snackbar
- MenuItemCard: show active/inactive status instead of placeholder stock
  label, dim inactive items visually in both list and grid layouts
